-- (ClientRenderRequest / ClientCommunication / ClientInvoke) and plays the
-- corresponding VFX, SFX, cutscenes, projectiles, camera work, and builds the
-- topbar / settings UI.
--
-- This file is a cleaned-up version of a decompiled script:
--   * decompiler artifacts removed ("-- line:" / "-- upvalues:" comments)
--   * ~5,600 obfuscated register names (p8, v269, t4, u21, ...) renamed to
--     descriptive names; ~1,750 small one-off locals inside the big render
--     request handler are left as-is
--   * indentation normalized to tabs (some regions had been hand-patched with
--     space indentation; their comments and logic are preserved verbatim)
--   * section banner comments added for navigation
-- No logic was restructured, reordered or simplified.
--
-- Verified equivalent: compiling this file and the original decompiled file
-- with `luau-compile -g0 -O0` produces byte-for-byte identical bytecode.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

